  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[D]\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[D] [Bb]I've used hammers made out of wood\n[Cadd9] [C#] [D]I have played games with pieces and rules\n[Bb] [Cadd9] [C#] [D]I undeciphered tricks at the bar\nBut now you're gone, I haven't figured out why\n[Bb] [Cadd9] [C#] [D]I've come up with riddles and jokes about war\n[Bb] [Cadd9] [C#] [D]I've figured out numbers and what they're for\n[Bb] [Cadd9] [C#]I've understood feelings and I've understood words\nBut how could you be taken away?\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[Dmaj7]And wherever you've gone, and wherever we might [Bm]go\n[A]It don't seem fair, today just disappeared\n[Dmaj7]Your light's reflected now, reflected from a[Bm]far\n[A]We were but stones, your light made us [D]stars.\n[Bb] [Cadd9] [D] [Bb]\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[D] [Bb]With heavy breath, awakened regrets\n[Cadd9] [C#] [D]Back pages and days alone that coulda been spent\n[Bb] [Cadd9]Together, but we were miles apart\n[C#] [D]Every inch between us becomes light years now\n[Bb] [Cadd9]No time to be void or save up on life\n[C#]Oh, you gotta spend it all\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[Dmaj7]And wherever you've gone, and wherever we might [Bm]go\n[A]It don't seem fair, you seemed to like it here [Dmaj7]\n[Bm]Your light's reflected now, reflected from afar\n[A]We were but stones, your light made us [D] [A]stars\n\n{section: Ponte}\n[A] [C] [B] [A]\n\n{section: Solo}\n[C] [B] [A] [C] [B] [C] [B]\n[C]\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[Dmaj7]And wherever you've gone, and wherever we might [Bm]go\n[A]It don't seem fair, today just disappeared [Dmaj7]\n[Bm]Your light's reflected now, reflected from afar\n[A]We were but stones, your light made us [D] [Bb] [Cadd9] [D] [Bb] [Cadd9]stars\n\n{section: Outro}\n[D] [Bb] [Cadd9] (x4, fade)"
